			description: [
				"The starter generator. Feed it anything a furnace would burn"
				"and it turns fuel into FE — slowly, but for almost nothing."
				""
				"It keeps one or two machines alive. Drop a better capacitor in"
				"the upgrade slot when you need more speed and a deeper buffer."
			]
